      "content": "i feel like i'm just going through the motions. i go to work, i come home, i eat... but it's like i'm already dead inside. everything just feels so heavy and pointless. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to feel this void anymore. sometimes i just sit in the dark and wonder why i'm even trying to keep going.",
