      "content": "it just feels so exhausting. like, every single morning i wake up and the first thing i feel is this crushing weight in my chest. i look at his things and i just wish i could be back there with him. it feels more real to be with him than to be here alone in this house. wouldn't it just be easier if we were together again?",
